 Library/LvglLib/lv_port_indev.c               | 12 +--
 LvglDisplayEngineDxe/LvglAptioChrome.c        | 18 ++--
 LvglDisplayEngineDxe/LvglDesktop.c            |  6 +-
 LvglDisplayEngineDxe/LvglDisplayEngineDxe.inf |  5 --
 LvglDisplayEngineDxe/LvglFormRenderer.c       | 85 ++++++++++---------
 6 files changed, 65 insertions(+), 65 deletions(-)

